		{
			"id": "wOqgFmSe",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 681.554543152559,
			"y": 222.75187532594896,
			"width": 558.5274658203125,
			"height": 300,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "a7G",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 378447656,
			"version": 169,
			"versionNonce": 1328032344,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1784522945589,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new to open, remember, or\nmaintain (you mentioned creating an agent at some point to give us\nimprovement metrics) \n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already work (Obsidian), read where\nwe already talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no browser setup, no cron jobs,\nnothing that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically: pace vs goals, who's carrying the\nweek, what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything we could build- pure signal, no\nupkeep",
			"rawText": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new to open, remember, or maintain (you mentioned creating an agent at some point to give us improvement metrics) \n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already work (Obsidian), read where we already talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no browser setup, no cron jobs, nothing that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically: pace vs goals, who's carrying the week, what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything we could build- pure signal, no upkeep",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "rightbodyrect",
			"originalText": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new to open, remember, or maintain (you mentioned creating an agent at some point to give us improvement metrics) \n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already work (Obsidian), read where we already talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no browser setup, no cron jobs, nothing that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically: pace vs goals, who's carrying the week, what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything we could build- pure signal, no upkeep",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
